l\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/29-51.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsiri ya Al-Ankaboot 29:51 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Je! Kwani hayakuwatosha ya kwamba tumekuteremshia Kitabu hiki wanacho somewa? Hakika katika hayo zipo rehema na mawaidha kwa watu wanao amini.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Mwanzo\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Al-Ankaboot\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/surah/29.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Aya 51\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/29-51.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> › <a href=\"/sw/surah/29.html\">Sura Al-Ankaboot</a> › Aya 51</nav><h1>Tafsiri ya Sura Al-Ankaboot 29:51</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿أَوَلَمْ يَكْفِهِمْ أَنَّا أَنزَلْنَا عَلَيْكَ الْكِتَابَ يُتْلَىٰ عَلَيْهِمْ إِنَّ فِي ذَٰلِكَ لَرَحْمَةً وَذِكْرَىٰ لِقَوْمٍ يُؤْمِنُونَ﴾</p><section><h3>Tafsiri ya maana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Je! Kwani hayakuwatosha ya kwamba tumekuteremshia Kitabu hiki wanacho somewa? Hakika katika hayo zipo rehema na mawaidha kwa watu wanao amini.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Swahili Translation - Ali Mohsin Al-Barwani — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Maneno ya maimamu wawili yametolewa kwa Kiarabu asilia, neno kwa neno, pamoja na marejeo.</p><section><h2>Sheikh al-Islam Ibn Taymiyyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فزجر من لم يكتف بالكتاب المنزل.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 19/67</cite></blockquote><h3>Aliyoyanukuu kutoka kwa wengine</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم</span> <span class=\"st\">استشهد به</span> «{عن النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم أنه رأى بيد عمر بن الخطاب شيئا من التوراة فقال: لو كان موسى حيا ثم اتبعتموه وتركتموني لضللتم.} وفي رواية {ما وسعه إلا اتباعي.}»<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 17/41</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فأخبر سبحانه أن الكتاب الذي أنزله على رسوله يكفي<cite>«مدارج السالكين بين منازل إياك نعبد وإياك نستعين» 3/435</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ففيه الحجة والدلالة على أنه من الله، وأن الله سبحانه أرسل به رسوله وفيه بيان ما يوجب لمن اتبعه السعادة، وينجيه من العذاب،<cite>«مدارج السالكين بين منازل إياك نعبد وإياك نستعين» 3/435</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=sw#s29a51\">Fungua katika tafsiri shirikishi (maandiko kamili)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/sw/ayah/29-49.html\">Aya iliyotangulia (29:49)</a><a href=\"/sw/ayah/29-52.html\">Aya inayofuata (29:52)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsiri ya Masheikh Wawili · <a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Kuhusu mradi</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Faragha na masharti</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/29-52.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"sw\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsiri ya Al-Ankaboot 29:52 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Sema: Mwenyezi Mungu anatosha kuwa ni Shahidi baina yangu na nyinyi. Anayajua yaliomo katika mbingu na ardhi. Na wale wanao amini upotovu na wakamkataa Mwe\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsiri ya Al-Ankaboot 29:52 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Sema: Mwenyezi Mungu anatosha kuwa ni Shahidi baina yangu na nyinyi. Anayajua yaliomo katika mbingu na ardhi. Na wale wanao amini upotovu na wakamkataa Mwe\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Mwanzo\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Al-Ankaboot\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/surah/29.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Aya 52\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/29-52.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> › <a href=\"/sw/surah/29.html\">Sura Al-Ankaboot</a> › Aya 52</nav><h1>Tafsiri ya Sura Al-Ankaboot 29:52</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿قُلْ كَفَىٰ بِاللَّهِ بَيْنِي وَبَيْنَكُمْ شَهِيدًا يَعْلَمُ مَا فِي السَّمَاوَاتِ وَالْأَرْضِ وَالَّذِينَ آمَنُوا بِالْبَاطِلِ وَكَفَرُوا بِاللَّهِ أُولَٰئِكَ هُمُ الْخَاسِرُونَ﴾</p><section><h3>Tafsiri ya maana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Sema: Mwenyezi Mungu anatosha kuwa ni Shahidi baina yangu na nyinyi. Anayajua yaliomo katika mbingu na ardhi. Na wale wanao amini upotovu na wakamkataa Mwenyezi Mungu, hao ndio walio khasiri.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Swahili Translation - Ali Mohsin Al-Barwani — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Maneno ya maimamu wawili yametolewa kwa Kiarabu asilia, neno kwa neno, pamoja na marejeo.</p><section><h2>Sheikh al-Islam Ibn Taymiyyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فإنه إذا كان عالما بالأشياء كانت شهادته بعلم وقد بين شهادته بالآيات الدالة على صدق الرسول ومنها القرآن<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 14/191</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فإذا كان الله سبحانه عالما بجميع الأشياء؛ كانت شهادته أصدق شهادة وأعدلها، فإنها شهادة بعلم تام، محيط بالمشهود به، فيكون الشاهد به أعدل الشهداء وأصدقهم،<cite>«مدارج السالكين بين منازل إياك نعبد وإياك نستعين» 3/435</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=sw#s29a52\">Fungua katika tafsiri shirikishi (maandiko kamili)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/sw/ayah/29-51.html\">Aya iliyotangulia (29:51)</a><a href=\"/sw/ayah/29-61.html\">Aya inayofuata (29:61)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsiri ya Masheikh Wawili · <a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Kuhusu mradi</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Faragha na masharti</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/29-61.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"sw\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsiri ya Al-Ankaboot 29:61 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Na ukiwauliza; Nani aliye umba mbingu na ardhi na akafanya jua na mwezi kuti&#x27;ii amri yake? Bila ya shaka, watasema: Mwenyezi Mungu. Wapi basi wanako geuzwa\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsiri ya Al-Ankaboot 29:61 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Na ukiwauliza; Nani aliye umba mbingu na ardhi na akafanya jua na mwezi kuti&#x27;ii amri yake? Bila ya shaka, watasema: Mwenyezi Mungu. Wapi basi wanako geuzwa\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Mwanzo\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Al-Ankaboot\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/surah/29.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Aya 61\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/29-61.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> › <a href=\"/sw/surah/29.html\">Sura Al-Ankaboot</a> › Aya 61</nav><h1>Tafsiri ya Sura Al-Ankaboot 29:61</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَلَئِن سَأَلْتَهُم مَّنْ خَلَقَ السَّمَاوَاتِ وَالْأَرْضَ وَسَخَّرَ الشَّمْسَ وَالْقَمَرَ لَيَقُولُنَّ اللَّهُ فَأَنَّىٰ يُؤْفَكُونَ﴾</p><section><h3>Tafsiri ya maana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Na ukiwauliza; Nani aliye umba mbingu na ardhi na akafanya jua na mwezi kuti&#x27;ii amri yake? Bila ya shaka, watasema: Mwenyezi Mungu. Wapi basi wanako geuzwa?</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Swahili Translation - Ali Mohsin Al-Barwani — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Maneno ya maimamu wawili yametolewa kwa Kiarabu asilia, neno kwa neno, pamoja na marejeo.</p><section><h2>Sheikh al-Islam Ibn Taymiyyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فالكفار المشركون مقرون أن الله خالق السموات والأرض<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 11/51</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ولكنهم مع هذا مشركون به في ألوهيته بأن يعبدوا معه آلهة أخرى يتخذونها شفعاء أو شركاء؛ أو في ربوبيته بأن يجعلوا غيره رب بعض الكائنات دونه مع اعترافهم بأنه رب ذلك الرب وخالق ذلك الخلق.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 11/51</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=sw#s29a61\">Fungua katika tafsiri shirikishi (maandiko kamili)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/sw/ayah/29-52.html\">Aya iliyotangulia (29:52)</a><a href=\"/sw/ayah/29-64.html\">Aya inayofuata (29:64)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsiri ya Masheikh Wawili · <a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Kuhusu mradi</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Faragha na masharti</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/29-64.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"sw\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsiri ya Al-Ankaboot 29:64 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Na haya maisha ya dunia si chochote ila ni pumbao na mchezo. Na nyumba ya Akhera ndiyo maisha khasa; laiti wangeli kuwa wanajua!\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/29-64.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/29-64.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/29-64.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/29-64.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/29-64.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/29-64.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/29-64.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/29-64.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/29-64.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/29-64.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/29-64.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/29-64.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/29-64.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/29-64.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/29-64.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/29-64.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/29-64.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsiri ya Al-Ankaboot 29:64 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Na haya maisha ya dunia si chochote ila ni pumbao na mchezo. Na nyumba ya Akhera ndiyo maisha khasa; laiti wangeli kuwa wanajua!\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Mwanzo\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Al-Ankaboot\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/surah/29.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Aya 64\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/29-64.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> › <a href=\"/sw/surah/29.html\">Sura Al-Ankaboot</a> › Aya 64</nav><h1>Tafsiri ya Sura Al-Ankaboot 29:64</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَمَا هَٰذِهِ الْحَيَاةُ الدُّنْيَا إِلَّا لَهْوٌ وَلَعِبٌ وَإِنَّ الدَّارَ الْآخِرَةَ لَهِيَ الْحَيَوَانُ لَوْ كَانُوا يَعْلَمُونَ﴾</p><section><h3>Tafsiri ya maana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Na haya maisha ya dunia si chochote ila ni pumbao na mchezo. Na nyumba ya Akhera ndiyo maisha khasa; laiti wangeli kuwa wanajua!</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Swahili Translation - Ali Mohsin Al-Barwani — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Maneno ya maimamu wawili yametolewa kwa Kiarabu asilia, neno kwa neno, pamoja na marejeo.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">والمراد الجنة عند أهل التفسير<cite>«حادي الأرواح إلى بلاد الأفراح» 1/98</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وأهل اللغة على أن الحيوان بمعنى الحياة<cite>«حادي الأرواح إلى بلاد الأفراح» 1/98</cite></blockquote><h3>Aliyoyanukuu kutoka kwa wengine</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">أهل التفسير</span> <span class=\"st\">أقرّه</span> «وأن الآخرة يعني الجنة لهي الحيوان لهي دار الحياة التي لا موت فيها»<cite>«حادي الأرواح إلى بلاد الأفراح» 1/98</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">الكلبي</span> <span class=\"st\">حكاه</span> «هي حياة لا موت فيها»<cite>«حادي الأرواح إلى بلاد الأفراح» 1/98</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">الزجاج</span> <span class=\"st\">حكاه</span> «هي دار الحياة الدائمة»<cite>«حادي الأرواح إلى بلاد الأفراح» 1/98</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">أبو عبيدة</span> <span class=\"st\">حكاه</span> «الحياة والحيوان والحي بكسر الحاء واحد»<cite>«حادي الأرواح إلى بلاد الأفراح» 1/98</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=sw#s29a64\">Fungua katika tafsiri shirikishi (maandiko kamili)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/sw/ayah/29-61.html\">Aya iliyotangulia (29:61)</a><a href=\"/sw/ayah/29-67.html\">Aya inayofuata (29:67)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsiri ya Masheikh Wawili · <a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Kuhusu mradi</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Faragha na masharti</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/29-67.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"sw\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsiri ya Al-Ankaboot 29:67 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Je! Hawaoni ya kwamba tumeifanya nchi takatifu ina amani, na hali watu wengine wananyakuliwa kote kwa majirani zao? Je! Wanaamini upotovu, na neema za Mw